DTEND:20261215T130000Z
SUMMARY:Deadline 07:00 CST: Sony Future Filmmaker Awards 2027 (Fiction\, No
 n-Fiction\, Animation\, Immersive\, Future Format)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 15 Dec 2026 at 07:00 CST.\n\nA free international short 
 film competition run by Sony\, with an Immersive category for 180 and 360 
 degree work alongside Fiction\, Non-Fiction\, Animation and Future Format.
  Films must have been released between 1 January 2025 and 15 December 2026
 \, in English or subtitled. Shortlisted filmmakers attend a programme at S
 ony Pictures Studios in Culver City in June 2027.\n\nOrganisation: Sony Gr
 oup\nLocation: Remote submission. Shortlisted filmmakers are flown to Sony
  Pictures Studios\, Culver City\, 7-10 June 2027.\nAward: USD 5\,000 cash 
 to each winner of Fiction\, Non-Fiction\, Animation and Immersive (180/360
 )\; USD 2\,500 for Future Format. The Student category awards equipment on
 ly.\nDuration: Competition\; films released 1 January 2025 to 15 December 
 2026.\n\nMore: https://www.sonyfuturefilmmakerawards.com/competition/enter
 ?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.sonyfuturefilmmakerawards.com/competition/enter?utm_source=
 artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Remote submission. Shortlisted filmmakers are flown to Sony Pictur
 es Studios\, Culver City\, 7-10 June 2027.
END:VEVENT
